{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里仍没底，开始重新想眼前还能承担什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里仍没底\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他已经试过，行动带来的力气并不能消掉对那种生活的牵挂。\",\n      \"key\": \"消不掉牵挂\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想到，难处不在自己不够坚定：行动给他力气，那种生活给他安慰，两样都舍不得，却很难不伤到其中一样。\",\n      \"key\": \"两样都舍不得\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"text\": \"想到要付出的代价，他心里还是疼，盼着别失去太多。\",\n      \"key\": \"心里还是疼\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他没想出两全办法，也怕争取伤到安宁，可不争取也护不住珍惜的东西，他仍带着怕先去争取。\",\n      \"key\": \"带着怕先去争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R50\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩保留\",\n      \"why\": \"保留两难的逼迫松动后，他仍没底，却开始重新考虑自己能承担什么。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\", \"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-2\", \"S11-4\", \"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并接回前因\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动带来力气却消不掉牵挂、旧愿带来安慰却不能独自护住珍惜之物；后一个限度由S07-2的真实经历支撑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\", \"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补回实质判断\",\n      \"why\": \"保留难处不在意志不足、两样都真心珍惜且难以无损兼得的意思，补回上一轮被弱化的判断，不再把暂时没找到办法当成两者必然冲突的全部解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\", \"R57\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-5\", \"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"分工保留\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-5保留想到代价时的心疼和不愿失去太多；S11-6保留不争取也护不住珍惜之物的具体理由，并把行动理由接回S07-2，不再用S10-5代替。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S11-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留恐惧和不舍仍在、他却开始承担眼前之事的转变，删去重复的抽象行动原则。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "558273de-7c74-4629-84fb-e5b67ca425c1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T213256638754Z", "elapsed_seconds": 284.782, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T21:37:41.431218+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3fe80681bf44ccbc2d174bff562fff81f9677a951af87a76816d24f815f10a4f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f